This project's CODE is MIT-licensed. The DATA it acquires is not, and carries
its own terms:

Copernicus Sentinel-2
  Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data. Free, full and open access under
  the Copernicus data policy (Regulation (EU) No 1159/2013).
  COGs hosted by Element 84 on the AWS Open Data registry.
  https://registry.opendata.aws/sentinel-2-l2a-cogs/

OpenStreetMap
  River geometry and place names © OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under
  the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0.
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

NASA POWER
  Free and open, no restrictions on use. Please cite the NASA Langley Research
  Center POWER Project.
  https://power.larc.nasa.gov/

Open-Meteo (ERA5 archive)
  CC-BY-4.0. Underlying ERA5 data © ECMWF / Copernicus Climate Change Service.
  https://open-meteo.com/en/license

Basemap tiles
  Esri World Imagery © Esri, Maxar, Earthstar Geographics.
  OpenStreetMap tiles © OpenStreetMap contributors, subject to the OSMF tile
  usage policy. Both are used without an account for low-volume display.
